pname:samplerYcbcrConversion specifies whether the implementation
supports <<samplers-YCbCr-conversion,sampler {YCbCr} conversion>>.
If pname:samplerYcbcrConversion is ename:VK_FALSE, sampler {YCbCr}
conversion is not supported, and samplers using sampler {YCbCr}
conversion must: not be used.

pname:samplerYcbcrConversion specifies whether the implementation
supports <<samplers-YCbCr-conversion,sampler {YCbCr} conversion>>.
If pname:samplerYcbcrConversion is ename:VK_FALSE, sampler {YCbCr}
conversion is not supported, and samplers using sampler {YCbCr}
conversion must: not be used.

pname:dynamicRenderingLocalReadDepthStencilAttachments is ename:VK_TRUE
if the implementation supports local reads of depth/stencil attachments,
ename:VK_FALSE otherwise.

pname:dynamicRenderingLocalReadMultisampledAttachments is ename:VK_TRUE
if the implementation supports local reads of multisampled attachments,
ename:VK_FALSE otherwise.

